srow(303, 12, 'MATERIAL', f'"WHICH YOU COMMANDED ME" — I HAVE NOT GIVEN IT TO ONE UNFIT FOR IT. ({SP_(303, 12, "לא", "נתתיו", "למי", "שאינו", "ראוי", "לו")} "I have not given it to one who is not fit for it"): the recipients fit — the gift to the right hand. Fresh.')
srow(303, 13, 'MATERIAL', f'"I HAVE NOT TRANSGRESSED YOUR COMMANDMENTS" — I HAVE NOT SEPARATED FROM ONE KIND FOR ANOTHER, NOT FROM THE PLUCKED FOR THE ATTACHED NOR THE ATTACHED FOR THE PLUCKED, NOT FROM THE NEW FOR THE OLD NOR THE OLD FOR THE NEW. ({SP_(303, 13, "לא", "הפרשתי", "ממין", "על", "שאינו", "מינו")} "I have not separated from a kind for what is not its kind"; {SP_(303, 13, "מן", "התלוש", "על", "המחבר")} "from the plucked for the attached"; {SP_(303, 13, "מן", "החדש", "על", "הישן")} "from the new for the old"): THE SEPARATION\'S RULES — kind for kind, state for state, year for year (Maaser Sheni 5:11; Terumot 1-2\'s law). Fresh.')
