srow(303, 20, 'MATERIAL', f'"LOOK DOWN FROM YOUR HOLY HABITATION" (26:15) — WE HAVE DONE WHAT YOU DECREED ON US; DO FOR US WHAT YOU PROMISED US: "LOOK DOWN FROM YOUR HOLY HABITATION FROM HEAVEN AND BLESS YOUR PEOPLE". The piska\'s last row ({SP_(303, 20, "עשינו", "מה", "שגזרת", "עלינו")} "we have done what You decreed upon us"; {SP_(303, 20, "עשה", "עמנו", "מה", "שהבטחתנו")} "do with us what You promised us"): THE PETITION after the confession — the covenant\'s two sides (Maaser Sheni 5:13\'s "with sons and daughters" the translator supplies); the Sifrei\'s last row on the chapter — 304 opens at 31:14. Fresh.')
